            "review_title": "Review at iSushi Thiso Mall",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n26\nNice sushi and sashimi in Sala\nSep 2024 • Couples\nWe came here for an early lunch and were the first diners. We ordered an entree of sashimi and a large bowl of mixed sushi. Everything was delicious. Service was also very prompt and friendly. All in all, pretty good for a restaurant based on the 4th floor of a shopping mall.\nWritten September 6, 2024",
